  "method": "A general reader for SerializedExpressionNodeGraph resources (expression-graphs/exdis.py) was written from the format recovered in L4016 and run on the seven resources. The header gives data size (offset 36), code size in words (44), an 8-byte table count (56) and the call count (60); the code start is the position at which every call instruction's next field equals its own length. Operand kinds 3 and above are inputs: instruction 0x2e binds an input frame offset to a kind. Each graph's source asset lists its inputs as (name hash, frame offset); the hash is h = h * 33 xor c from 5381 over the case-sensitive name, which matches all 16 input names exactly.",
